<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38918" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβῐόω</span></b> , only in aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εβίων</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live over</i> or <i>after, survive</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεβίω</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο ἔτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.65
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεβίων διὰ παντὸς [τοῦ
			πολέμου</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβιόντος</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . πένθ᾽ ἡμέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					41.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				2.45
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷς ἂν . . ἐπιβιῶ</span>
			<i>live to see</i>
			<i>married</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				361d
			</span></i>. (Freq. corrupted to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βιοῦντα</span>, etc. in codd.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
